<title>MALAYSIA: New Straits Times year net up 13 pct.</title>
<headline>New Straits Times year net up 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Aug 31, 1996</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  108.22	  vs	   95.40</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	  56.0	   vs	   53.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		    737.16	  vs	  622.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    170.55	  vs	  148.87</p>
<p>    Minorities		    0.60	  vs	    0.20</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    less   2.01	  vs   add    2.15</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	  15.0	   vs	   15.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the company is The New Straits Times Press (Malaysia) Bhd. It publishes newspapers and magazines.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
